# The machine going off, the second of two runs, on the disk the first left:
# every volume was taken down properly, and what was kept can be read.
expect taken down properly the last time
absent not taken down properly
filehas /boot/SDNWIN.TXT
want ok 19
filehas /boot/SDNBG.TXT
want ok 22
open 019b54a4-6ccf-72f7-e320-c98e4a0bab4e
expect calc: ready
wait 800
logmark
reboot
expectsincein 40 TessronOS desktop: starting the machine again
expectsincein 20 marked clean
